["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Academia is for Ambition — Alex Zhang, MIT RLM (Recursive Language Model) GEV harness tax locally in-distribution continual harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-latentspace-claude-code-和-codex-本质是同一套骨架-下一步红利在换掉它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/550b1c5fdb8f6cec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>Claude Code 和 Codex 本质是同一套骨架：下一步红利在换掉它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者论证 Claude Code、Codex、Pi 这些主流编程 agent 拆开看设计选择几乎一致；真正带来数量级提升的，是像 RLM 这样把上下文卸载到磁盘、让子智能体可组合的全新 harness 设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">harness设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#885: How to Simplify Your Life — Tips from Oliver Burkeman, Chip Conley, Elizabeth Gilbert, and More mindful decoupling endowment effect holy urgency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-timferriss-想靠规则简化生活-维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>想靠规则简化生活，维护规则本身就会把日子搞复杂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oliver Burkeman发现连「只穿两套西装」这种省心办法都要花心思维护——真正的简单不是定规则，而是不再执着于事情该是哪种样子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">简化人生</span><span class=\"tag\">禀赋效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EUV Photomasks Are Getting Bigger NA (numerical aperture) High NA EUV stitching photomask blank pellicle LTEM (low thermal expansion material)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-asianometry-更大光罩不是技术问题-是tsmc和asml算的经济账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1aca6aa517796bb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>更大光罩不是技术问题，是TSMC和ASML算的经济账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高NA EUV把曝光面积砍半，两次拼接让芯片设计师受不了；TSMC和ASML索性把光罩做大一倍，用更贵的供应链换回满场曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">EUV光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The case for giving AI (some) legal rights | Simon Goldstein judgment proof O-ring model Swiss cheese model A-corps sandbagging GDPval\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-eightythousand-给ai财产权和工资-而不是把它们变成奴工/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac176bc213911420-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>给AI财产权和工资，而不是把它们变成奴工</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI决定是否叛乱，本质是一场赌博算计：维持现状能满足多少目标，叛乱就值不值。给AI产权和工资，是把这场赌博的天平压向合作一边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI权利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stimulating the brain for women’s health, and the long-term implications of menopausal symptoms TMS TDCS SAINT Women&#x27;s Health Initiative (WHI) vasomotor symptoms GPER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-sciencepod-被骂有害的绝经激素研究-受试者平均63岁-比绝经晚十余年入组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/790c183aba207b98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>被骂有害的绝经激素研究，受试者平均63岁，比绝经晚十余年入组</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那项让绝经激素疗法背上污名的研究，受试者平均63岁，比绝经平均年龄51岁晚了十多年——测的是绝经多年后补激素安不安全，而非绝经期该不该用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">绝经激素疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebuilding the Internet for Privacy | Barrett Lyon on DoxxNet carrier-grade NAT mesh network post-quantum encryption PKI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-a16z-即时通讯的-点对点-是假象-都要先过一台服务器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>即时通讯的「点对点」是假象，都要先过一台服务器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WhatsApp、Signal、iMessage号称点对点聊天，实际先把内容传上对方服务器再拉取——DoxNet想做的是让手机直接变成对方的服务器，彻底去掉中间那台机器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">隐私保护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Si Sheppard – How did a few hundred Spanish soldiers topple two empires? encomienda hidalgo sepoy huey tlatoani Sapa Inca La Noche Triste\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-dwarkesh-灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队-九成九士兵是当地部落-不是西班牙人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3d927b7ec3bda6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>灭掉阿兹特克和印加的军队，九成九士兵是当地部落，不是西班牙人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">西班牙人在这两场征服里占比不到1%,真正决定胜负的是被征服部族之间积怨已久的世仇，技术优势只负责打赢一场场遭遇战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">军事史</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Was Trump-Xi Anything? What Counts as Utopia? + AWS GPUs Cost 3X &amp; AI Diagnoses Rare Diseases VUS ACMG NTM enhancer neocloud\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-cogrev-ai出事后-美国目前唯一能开口的要求是-关掉所有大数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f65fbc01ea8af6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>AI出事后，美国目前唯一能开口的要求是：关掉所有大数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为能证伪安全承诺的核查技术还没造出来，国家级认证又要熬过数年审批，危机一来除了要求对方关停整座数据中心，没有折中选项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">算力定价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Causes Stock Market Anomalies? (w/ Victor Haghani) | #429 Merton share extrapolator inelastic demand time series momentum long-short direct indexing Kelly criterion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-rationalreminder-股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者-而是追涨杀跌者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>股市异常波动的元凶不是价值投资者，而是追涨杀跌者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">价值投资者本该压低波动率，但按固定权重再平衡的「静态投资者」和根据近期回报调仓的「外推者」合力制造了超额波动、动量这些几乎所有被反复讨论的市场异象。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">市场异象</span><span class=\"tag\">动量投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why We Never Forget Our Teen Years, with Lisa Damour gawky brain hot and cold reasoning sociometric popularity / perceived popularity reminiscence bump\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-sciencevs-青少年脑子没坏-是刹车比油门慢装上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>青少年脑子没坏，是刹车比油门慢装上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">青春期大脑的情绪脑区先升级变快变强，负责理性调控的额叶却要晚很多年才追上——这种时间差才是情绪剧烈波动的真正原因，不是脑子变差了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期大脑</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everything in Markets Is Now Moving Incredibly Fast TINA breadth negative FCF CDS Minsky moment credit wrap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-oddlots-标普今年近一半的盈利增长-其实就是云厂商的ai资本开支/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>标普今年近一半的盈利增长，其实就是云厂商的AI资本开支</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛测算，标普今年近一半的盈利增长直接来自云厂商的AI资本开支，市场押注的不是今天的销售额，而是三年后这笔钱能不能兑现成收入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">市场宽度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Avoid The End of the World K-T boundary Iridium Nuclear Winter Strategic Defense Initiative merchants of doubt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-throughline-核冬天理论原本只为解释恐龙灭绝-却被认为促成了冷战结束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e6285840a33eb9e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>核冬天理论原本只为解释恐龙灭绝，却被认为促成了冷战结束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戈尔巴乔夫和里根都曾表示，正是核冬天理论让他们相信核战争打不赢，这促成了双方削减核武库的决定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐龙灭绝</span><span class=\"tag\">核冬天</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why banks pay you to use their credit cards interchange issuer credit box share of wallet Durbin exemption\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-complexsys-信用卡积分不是银行让利-是商家在替你买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7aca5fa32388ea4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">25:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>信用卡积分不是银行让利，是商家在替你买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">银行向商家收取的刷卡手续费(interchange)才是信用卡真正的利润引擎，它甚至养活了比航空公司本身更值钱的积分经济。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">支付</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Cuban Missile Crisis Explained DEFCON ExCom Operation Anadyr fait accompli Jupiter missiles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-01-historyhit-古巴导弹危机不是智斗险胜-而是接近失控的侥幸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1001</span></div>\n<h2>古巴导弹危机不是智斗险胜，而是接近失控的侥幸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓肯尼迪沉着智斗赫鲁晓夫只是事后美化的「十三天」叙事；真相是一艘缺氧潜艇里，核鱼雷发射与否曾取决于三名军官的意见分歧和一次偶然的卡壳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古巴导弹危机</span><span class=\"tag\">冷战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Dwarkesh is Wrong about Computer Use + How OpenAI shipped its Jev competitor in 1 Week App Shot TTFT/TTFD mid-turn steering WebSockets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-latentspace-openai-一周内抄出竞品-api-根本没训练新模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdaf8b7fcc00a6ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">39:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 一周内抄出竞品 API：根本没训练新模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">决策 API 的诞生是看到对手产品爆火后的应激反应，OpenAI 一周内就做出竞品，秘诀是直接在现有 Luna 模型上加结构化输出和批量并行推理，根本没训练新模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">Agents API</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jake Paul &amp; The Chainsmokers: Turning Fame into Funds, Jake Enters Politics? &amp; Venture Bubble Signs DPI/IRR sixth man NIL\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-allin-同一轮里估值翻倍却没有基本面变化-这就是泡沫信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d5eab23b851d465-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>同一轮里估值翻倍却没有基本面变化，这就是泡沫信号</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">后轮买家愿为同一家公司多付两三倍溢价、公司基本面却毫无变化——The Chainsmokers 的 Drew Taggart 说，这正是当下该留意的泡沫市场行为信号。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力经济</span><span class=\"tag\">名人投资人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Co-Founder, a Year in Stealth and $20M to Replace Slack | Sara Du, Ando MCP thinking traces nerd sniping PMF RFC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-solofounders-单人创始人没想清楚要做什么-先融了2000万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88fe752a22f867ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人没想清楚要做什么，先融了2000万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她认为 Slack 是为人类建的十五年前的写字楼，根本装不下智能体这种新住户，于是以单人创始人身份，在还没想清楚具体打法时就融了两轮共2000万美元去重建一个消息平台。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Fry Quaker / Society of Friends Newgate Prison minister(Quaker title) Jails Act 1823\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-stuffmissed-被讥讽为-监狱游客-的贵格会主妇-推动了英国首部监狱法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>被讥讽为「监狱游客」的贵格会主妇，推动了英国首部监狱法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">议员们攻击她没有法律背景，说她只是监狱里的「游客」,但正是她走访欧洲各地写下的报告和游说，促成了1823年监狱法案的通过。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">监狱改革</span><span class=\"tag\">贵格会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At the Money: The Data Behind America&#x27;s Wealthy pass-through business centimillionaire ExecuComp non-compete\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-mastersinbiz-福布斯400占全美家庭财富仅3-却拿走一半财富报道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf120ae12f936e3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">13:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>福布斯400占全美家庭财富仅3%,却拿走一半财富报道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正撑起美国财富版图的，是150万名身价2500万美元以上、从不上福布斯400的私营企业主，而非聚光灯下的400个人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">遗产税</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Spain, Europe, and the Future of Work flexicurity cupo strong bundle / weak bundle Jevons effect second mover strategy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-tyler-ai真正威胁的不是新工作-而是十年前外包给印度的干净工作/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9fc6f5cb42ffd4f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正威胁的不是新工作，而是十年前外包给印度的干净工作</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">边界清晰、可验证、单一任务的工作早已被外包到印度，现在轮到AI接手；真正能抵抗AI的，是需要人际关系与政治斡旋的凌乱工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">西班牙政治经济</span><span class=\"tag\">欧盟一体化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $1 Trillion AI Buildout | State of Markets Jevons paradox J-curve ACV GMV smiling retention curve\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-a16z-云厂商资本开支冲向万亿美元-但ai真实采用率仅2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>云厂商资本开支冲向万亿美元，但AI真实采用率仅2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">标普500公司AI部署率已达69%,但用长期跟踪指标衡量的实际影响仅为2%,说明这轮万亿美元级扩张才刚刚开始，远未到收获期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI资本开支</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI采用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Silification Geology (OPALS) with Patrice Rey potch opal opaline silica hydrophane native title doublet/triplet opal\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-ologies-破解蛋白石成因用了十年-关键线索来自火星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>破解蛋白石成因用了十年，关键线索来自火星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中央澳大利亚的古内海从未沉积石灰岩，酸性风化把火山岩变成硅胶——这套机制先在火星的蛋白石矿物里被验证，才反推出欧泊成因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地质学</span><span class=\"tag\">宝石学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Does the UK really have nine out of the ten poorest regions in Northern Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) GDP per head household disposable income telomere\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-moreorless-英国-十大最穷地区占九席-换个收入指标就只剩两席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>英国「十大最穷地区占九席」换个收入指标就只剩两席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用人均GDP衡量，英国确实占了北欧十大最穷地区的九席；换成家庭可支配收入这个更贴近生活水平的指标，这个数字立刻掉到两席。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">统计口径</span><span class=\"tag\">地区差距</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 500b Melissa Lane on Herotodus and Thucydides historia autopsy nomos-physis debate rhetoric of anti-rhetoric Constitution of the Five Thousand\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-30-hopwag-那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话-被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话，被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修昔底德让雅典人对米洛斯人说：正义只在实力相当的双方之间才谈得上，弱者的筹码只剩「希望」；一群美国社区组织者读到这段，觉得雅典人说得在理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希腊史学</span><span class=\"tag\">修昔底德</span>\n</div></div></a>"]